---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Accessibility — Better Pila" description="Better Pila accessibility commitment and feedback process.">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="narrow"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Accessibility</span></div><p class="eyebrow">Public by design</p><h1>Information must work for everyone.</h1></div></header>
  <article class="section narrow content paper">
    <p>Better Pila targets WCAG 2.2 Level AA and is designed for keyboard navigation, screen readers, text enlargement, narrow screens, and reduced motion.</p>
    <h2>Documents</h2><p>Important documents should have a useful HTML summary. Scanned files are marked when they still need OCR or accessibility remediation.</p>
    <h2>Report a barrier</h2><p>An accessibility contact will be published before launch. Include the page, the task you were attempting, and the assistive technology or browser involved when you are comfortable sharing it.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

